  "description": "Bedrock primitives shared across the Lumoin family: the sensitivity-aware BaseMemoryPool, the Tag metadata container, and the secure-memory substrate. Dependency-free and AOT / trim / browser-clean — platform-specific memory backings are injected, not referenced.",
  "iconFile": "resources/lumoin-base-nuget-logo.png",
